  59 007622  7200          CLA             /GUARD AGAINST NON-ZERO AC
  60 007623  1214          TAD S6260       /RKB1 IS SECOND HALF OF PACK
  61 007624  3207  SHNDC,  DCA SHNDLR      /SET BLOCK DISPLACEMENT ACCORDING TO SYS OR RKB0
  62 007625  7346          CLA CLL CMA RTL /AC=-3
  63 007626  3351          DCA SERRCT      /RETRY COUNT
  64 007627  6214          RDF
  65 007630  1217          TAD SCIF
  66 007631  3340          DCA SFIELD      /RESET USER INST FIELD FOR EXIT
