  91 007656  1352          TAD PAGCNT      /TEST TO SEE IF ONLY 1 PAGE WANTED
  92 007657  0336          AND S7600
  93 007660  7650          SNA CLA
  94 007661  1343          TAD S400        /100 WAS IN PAGCNT
  95 007662  1354          TAD CHKHED      /ADD IN CHECK HEADER FLAG
  96 007663  7112          CLL RTR         /SHIFT TO CORRECT BITS
  97 007664  1353          TAD RKECMD      /ADD IN BASE COMMAND
  98 007665  6746          DLDC            /LOAD COMMAND REGISTER
  99 007666  1352          TAD PAGCNT      /CHECK TO SEE IF DONE
 100 007667  7550          SPA SNA
