 102 007671  1336          TAD S7600       /DEDUCT 2 PAGES FORM TOTAL
 103 007672  3352          DCA PAGCNT      /SAVE FOR NEXT TIME
 104 007673  1350          TAD RKEBLK
 105 007674  6743          DLAG            /LOAD BLOCK REGISTER AND GO
